{{ g.heading('02','Read the limits beside the price','Instantly and Smartlead pricing.<br>What each plan allows.','All amounts are USD before tax. Annual prices are the advertised monthly equivalent with annual billing. Mailboxes, domains and optional data products are separate.') }}
{{ g.table('Published sending subscriptions, contact capacity and monthly email allowances',['Plan','Monthly billing','Annual monthly rate','Contact capacity','Emails / month'],guide.priceRows) }}
{{ g.sources([['Instantly pricing','https://instantly.ai/pricing'],['Smartlead pricing','https://www.smartlead.ai/pricing']]) }}
<div class="sg-two sg-after"><div><h3>Contacts are stored capacity.</h3><p>Instantly counts contacts in draft, paused and completed campaigns against the uploaded limit. Removing contacts from campaigns frees space; deleting them from a separate list does not.</p><p>Smartlead counts unique addresses, including contacts used across campaigns. Its contact limit does not renew each month. Smart and Prime advertise unlimited storage.</p>{{ g.sources([['Instantly contact limits','https://help.instantly.ai/en/articles/7918680-uploaded-contacts-limits'],['Smartlead contact and email quotas','https://helpcenter.smartlead.ai/en/articles/392-managing-lead-credits-and-email-credits-quota-in-smartlead']]) }}</div><div><h3>Sending capacity can disappear quickly.</h3><p>A list of 1,000 people with an opening email and three follow-ups can use up to 4,000 sends before replies. Build your budget around the full sequence.</p><p>Smartlead’s Unlimited Smart plan still has a 150,000-email monthly cap. A large send allowance also needs a suitable mailbox setup and a list worth contacting.</p></div></div>
<div class="dg-callout"><h3>The entry price is a solo price.</h3><p>Instantly Growth and Smartlead Base leave out independent team invitations. A team that shares campaign work should budget from Hypergrowth or Pro, respectively.</p></div>
</div></section>
<section class="lp-section" id="real-cost"><div class="lp-wrap">
{{ g.heading('03','Add the actual sending setup','What will the full setup cost?','Example: one team workspace, ten fresh Google mailboxes and two domains. Software uses monthly billing. Data and optional testing products cost extra.') }}
{{ g.table('Illustrative setup using each provider’s published mailbox and domain prices',['Cost','Instantly Hypergrowth','Smartlead Pro'],guide.budgetRows) }}
<p class="lp-small">Mailbox prices use Instantly’s Google setup and SmartSenders’ Zapmail Standard option. Other mailbox providers have different prices.</p>
{{ g.sources([['Instantly Google mailbox setup','https://help.instantly.ai/en/articles/9361043-done-for-you-google-email-setup'],['SmartSenders mailbox prices','https://helpcenter.smartlead.ai/en/articles/266-smartsenders-pricing']]) }}
<p class="sg-note"><strong>Keep control of your domains.</strong> SmartSenders says purchased domains expire after 12 months, along with their mailboxes. They cannot be renewed or transferred outside Smartlead. For a long-running campaign, connect mailboxes and domains you control. <a href="https://helpcenter.smartlead.ai/en/articles/256-smartsenders-faqs-and-troubleshooting-everything-you-need-to-know" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the purchase terms ↗</a></p>
<div class="sg-two sg-after"><div><h3>Prospect data has its own bill.</h3><p>Instantly sells separate data credits. Email searches, verification and AI replies use credits at different rates. Check the charge for each task before buying.</p><p>Smartlead’s prospect-email allowance costs another $59/month on Base and Pro. Smart and Prime include larger allowances. List verification is separate.</p>{{ g.sources([['Instantly data-credit rules','https://help.instantly.ai/en/articles/11381241-data-credit-system'],['Smartlead data allowances','https://www.smartlead.ai/faq']]) }}</div><div><h3>Client spaces add up.</h3><p>Instantly charges a separate subscription for each workspace. Three Hypergrowth workspaces cost <strong>$321/month</strong> before the sending accounts.</p><p>Smartlead Pro plus three paid client spaces costs <strong>$181/month</strong>. Check the permissions and capacity each client needs.</p>{{ g.sources([['Instantly workspace billing','https://help.instantly.ai/en/articles/6718773-manage-workspaces-and-team-members'],['Smartlead client fees','https://www.smartlead.ai/pricing']]) }}</div></div>
{{ g.midcta(guide,'Already emailing suitable prospects?','CallTeam can add the calls, follow up with the right people and book qualified meetings.') }}
</div></section>
